  "metaTitle": "RTD Denver Accidents",
  "metaDescription": "Denver's Regional Transport District public transit system is responsible for millions of rides a year. When an accident occurs, contact us.",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5af",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5ac",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.rtd-denver.com/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ab",
          "text": "If you are in downtown Denver, you may see many city buses owned by the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ad",
          "text": "Regional Transportation District",
          "marks": [
            "l5ac"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ae",
          "text": ", or RTD. You might also use the RTD’s regional rail service to get to places such as the Denver Airport or Westminster.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ak",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5ah",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ag",
          "text": "While these public transportation services are generally safe, accidents do happen. If you or a loved one has been injured in an RTD accident, a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ai",
          "text": "personal injury lawyer in Denver",
          "marks": [
            "l5ah"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5aj",
          "text": " can help you seek justice.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5am",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5al",
          "text": "What Are Examples of RTD Accidents in Denver?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ao",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5an",
          "text": "The Regional Transportation District is a large organization with over 100 bus routes and 10 rail lines. The RTD has an annual ridership of more than 64 million people on its commuter rail, light rail and buses as of 2023.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5aq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ap",
          "text": "Accidents involving RTD vehicles can describe:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
